{"title":"Beautiful Hand-Drawn Guide to The Legend of Zelda","link":"https://kottke.org/26/07/beautiful-hand-drawn-guide-to-the-legend-of-zelda","date":1784044200000,"content":"\n         \t<p><img src=\"/cdn-cgi/image/format=auto,fit=scale-down,width=1200,metadata=none//plus/misc/images/editor-1783954965-0fcec29d.jpg\" srcset=\"/cdn-cgi/image/format=auto,fit=scale-down,width=500,metadata=none//plus/misc/images/editor-1783954965-0fcec29d.jpg 500w, /cdn-cgi/image/format=auto,fit=scale-down,width=1200,metadata=none//plus/misc/images/editor-1783954965-0fcec29d.jpg 1200w\" loading=\"lazy\" /></p>\n\t<p><img src=\"/cdn-cgi/image/format=auto,fit=scale-down,width=1200,metadata=none//plus/misc/images/editor-1783954972-333bc50a.jpg\" srcset=\"/cdn-cgi/image/format=auto,fit=scale-down,width=500,metadata=none//plus/misc/images/editor-1783954972-333bc50a.jpg 500w, /cdn-cgi/image/format=auto,fit=scale-down,width=1200,metadata=none//plus/misc/images/editor-1783954972-333bc50a.jpg 1200w\" loading=\"lazy\" /></p>\n\t<p><img src=\"/cdn-cgi/image/format=auto,fit=scale-down,width=1200,metadata=none//plus/misc/images/editor-1783954992-8a59582c.jpg\" srcset=\"/cdn-cgi/image/format=auto,fit=scale-down,width=500,metadata=none//plus/misc/images/editor-1783954992-8a59582c.jpg 500w, /cdn-cgi/image/format=auto,fit=scale-down,width=1200,metadata=none//plus/misc/images/editor-1783954992-8a59582c.jpg 1200w\" loading=\"lazy\" /></p>\n\t<p><img src=\"/cdn-cgi/image/format=auto,fit=scale-down,width=1200,metadata=none//plus/misc/images/editor-1783955006-a7045b7c.jpg\" srcset=\"/cdn-cgi/image/format=auto,fit=scale-down,width=500,metadata=none//plus/misc/images/editor-1783955006-a7045b7c.jpg 500w, /cdn-cgi/image/format=auto,fit=scale-down,width=1200,metadata=none//plus/misc/images/editor-1783955006-a7045b7c.jpg 1200w\" loading=\"lazy\" /></p>\n\t<p><img src=\"/cdn-cgi/image/format=auto,fit=scale-down,width=1200,metadata=none//plus/misc/images/editor-1783955024-e27839d6.jpg\" srcset=\"/cdn-cgi/image/format=auto,fit=scale-down,width=500,metadata=none//plus/misc/images/editor-1783955024-e27839d6.jpg 500w, /cdn-cgi/image/format=auto,fit=scale-down,width=1200,metadata=none//plus/misc/images/editor-1783955024-e27839d6.jpg 1200w\" loading=\"lazy\" /></p>\n\t<p>Philip Summers hand-draws <a href=\"https://www.handdrawngameguides.com\">game guides for old school video games</a>. He’s done guides for games like <a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/exec/obidos/ASIN/B0G6FSRW81/ref=nosim/0sil8\">Mega Man</a>, <a href=\"https://handdrawngameguides.gumroad.com/l/handdrawngamingdigital?layout=profile\">Castlevania</a>, <a href=\"https://handdrawngameguides.gumroad.com/l/handdrawngamingdigital?layout=profile\">Teenage Mutant Ninja Turtles (NES)</a>, and <a href=\"https://www.handdrawngameguides.com/free-guides/metroid-presented-by-hand-drawn-game-guides\">Metroid</a>.</p>\n\t<p>But my favorite one is <a href=\"https://archive.org/details/legend-of-zelda-hdgg-digital/mode/2up\">The Legend of Zelda game guide</a> because Zelda was (and still is, tbh) my absolute favorite NES game — and you can <a href=\"https://archive.org/details/legend-of-zelda-hdgg-digital/mode/2up\">get it for free at the Internet Archive</a>. Somewhere in my personal archive is the map I drew for the second quest of Zelda; I also still have my original game cartridge.\n</p>\n \n\n        \n         <p><strong>Tags:</strong> <a href=\"https://kottke.org/tag/art\">art</a> · <a href=\"https://kottke.org/tag/Philip%20Summers\">Philip Summers</a> · <a href=\"https://kottke.org/tag/The%20Legend%20of%20Zelda\">The Legend of Zelda</a> · <a href=\"https://kottke.org/tag/video%20games\">video games</a></p>\n        \n    ","author":"Jason Kottke","siteTitle":"Kottke","siteHash":"89a883271b4598f9b33ebe87be70d38557bcd266e68aee521a8f93622e0ab723","entryHash":"895d17b7b9a42e35fef64ecf90e2dcdbefbf620680083bf9ca6086a9209e7dcc","category":"Sites"}